<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -Clear Channel restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Clear Channel restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz LLC said Tuesday it resumed coverage of Clear Channel Communications Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $68 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Vinton Vickers said in a research note his 1997 earnings estimate was $2.07 per share and his 1998 estimate was $2.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Since going public in 1984, the company has posted a consistent and impressive record of robust growth as a result of its management's operational prowess and discipline and opportunistic acquisition strategy,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Clear Channel's shares closed up 2-3/8 at 57-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
